From 51c48484e6c12bb9ed14c2420af190c40126a10a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zxilly <zhouxinyu1001@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 20:00:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/22] runtime, internal: implement wasm32 runtime and
 assembly

Add the wasm32 runtime and assembly for startup, stack switching, panic
recovery, memory operations, atomics, and bytealg routines. Adapt the
reflect stubs to the 32-bit ABI.

Use the existing single-threaded WebAssembly scheduler and sbrk
allocator. Check allocation rounding and memory growth for 32-bit
uintptr overflow.

Updates #63131

Change-Id: Ic3902f76fb6dd48dd84ca168fee3aac40e63ca4e

